310.         <h1 id="page-title">Contact our support team</h1>
311.         <p class="lede">
312.           Send us your details and we’ll get back to you as soon as we can.
313.           Full name and email are required. Phone number is optional.
314.         </p>
315.       </div>
316. 
317.       <div class="panel">
318.         <div class="form-header">
319.           <h2>Request help</h2>
320.           <p>Fields marked with <span aria-hidden="true" class="required-marker">*</span> are required.</p>
321.         </div>
322. 
323.         <form id="contact-form" novalidate>
324.           <div class="form-field">
325.             <label for="full-name">Full name <span class="required-marker" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
326.             <input
327.               id="full-name"
328.               name="fullName"
329.               type="text"
330.               autocomplete="name"
331.               required
332.               aria-describedby="full-name-error"
333.             >
334.             <p class="error-text" id="full-name-error" hidden>Error: Enter your full name.</p>
335.           </div>
336. 
